# Scratch worktrees the Agent tool creates for parallel work. Each is a
# full checkout of this repo, so committing them nests the repository
# inside itself, which `git add -A` does silently. They are also removed
# when the agents owning them finish, and are often being written while
# a build or a lint is running.
.claude/worktrees/
